Historical provenance retained intentionally
---------------------------------------------

AmberAgent Android has direct historical fork lineage from RikkaHub. The
current runtime no longer resolves the RikkaHub Maven forks, routes requests
to the retired Rikka search endpoint, or presents RikkaHub as the current
product repository. This engineering cleanup does not erase historical
authorship, Git provenance, copyright, trademark, or license obligations.

Historical reference: https://github.com/rikkahub/rikkahub at tag 2.4.11,
commit b270766f06671d7456ce3d248622dc667648b6d1. Its repository LICENSE and
the AmberAgent LICENSE remain the controlling texts for their respective
covered material. No legal conclusion beyond the recorded engineering facts
is asserted here.
